    ["Restriction"] = "Ограничение",
    ["One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven Eight Nine Ten One Two Three Four Five Six Seven"] = "Один Два Три Четыре Пять Шесть Семь Восемь Девять Десять",
